{"title":"Career roadmap · Playback/Live Performer","role":"Playback/Live Performer","summary":"A Playback/Live Performer is a professional vocalist or instrumentalist who performs music for films, television, streaming productions, concerts, festivals, events and independent releases. A BA in Music provides the artistic and theoretical foundation, but professional success depends heavily on performance ability, repertoire, recording experience, networking, stagecraft and a strong portfolio.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Music (Vocal / Instrumental)"},"about":[{"label":"Career-route check","text":"Strong direct alignment. Playback work is highly competitive and project-based, while live performance can provide an earlier route to professional experience and income."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Typical route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["BA Music","Stage/Studio Practice","Live Performance/Recording Projects","Session Musician / Independent Performer","Playback/Live Performer","Established Performer","Senior/Lead Artist / Independent Music Professional"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career objective"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Develop advanced musical technique, repertoire, stage confidence and professional recording skills."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Build credits through live shows, sessions, independent releases and auditions."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Develop a recognisable artistic identity and expand into larger productions/tours/playback work."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Establish a sustainable music career through performance, recordings, teaching, collaborations, licensing or music entrepreneurship."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Technique + music fundamentals"},{"text":"Music faculty/practice"},{"text":"Daily practice record"},{"text":"Musical foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Repertoire + performance confidence"},{"text":"Classical/contemporary repertoire"},{"text":"10 polished performances"},{"text":"Performance"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Recording + microphone technique"},{"text":"Studio sessions"},{"text":"5 recorded tracks"},{"text":"Studio skills"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"Live-stage skills"},{"text":"Concerts/open mics"},{"text":"10 live performances"},{"text":"Stagecraft"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Professional networking + collaborations"},{"text":"Musicians/producers"},{"text":"3 collaborations"},{"text":"Industry exposure"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Independent music/portfolio"},{"text":"Recording projects"},{"text":"3–5 professional releases"},{"text":"Artist identity"}],[{"text":"Honours Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Specialisation"},{"text":"Advanced training"},{"text":"Showcase/major performance"},{"text":"Expertise"}],[{"text":"Honours Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Professional launch"},{"text":"Auditions + networking"},{"text":"Demo reel + EPK"},{"text":"Employability"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects to prioritise"},{"type":"h","text":"For vocalists"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vocal technique"},{"text":"Voice culture"},{"text":"Breath control"},{"text":"Pitch"},{"text":"Rhythm"},{"text":"Music theory"},{"text":"Ear training"},{"text":"Performance practice"},{"text":"Hindustani/Carnatic/Western vocal techniques as applicable"},{"text":"Contemporary/popular music"},{"text":"Studio singing"},{"text":"Stage performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"For instrumentalists"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Instrument technique"},{"text":"Music theory"},{"text":"Harmony"},{"text":"Rhythm"},{"text":"Ear training"},{"text":"Ensemble performance"},{"text":"Improvisation"},{"text":"Sigh